{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radley Ravencroft's Spy Web Mystery is a point &amp; click murder mystery  set in a steampunk version of the American  1920s. Investigate digital recreations of the suspect's rooms in order to solve room escape style lock puzzles. These puzzles unlock video interviews with the suspects, which unlock event markers on your timeline. Draw connections between characters on your link board to unlock more investigations, and piece together the timeline of events for the day of the murder to solve the crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently contains:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - 10 fully playable levels with non-linear gameplay (one per character profile)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - 26 FMV interviews with the suspects (green squares)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - 12 pieces of evidence the player can view from the hub (blue squares)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - All necessary event markers for the player to solve the timeline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - A link board with which the player can establish connections between the characters and unlock new investigations</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649760?t=1745026632","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649760?t=1745026632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649760/1ce271b9185066afc1a21bee47cd925254fd1653/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745026632","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649760/1ce271b9185066afc1a21bee47cd925254fd1653/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745026632","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radley Ravencroft's Spy Web Mystery is a point &amp; click murder mystery  set 